   ],
   "evidence_class": "structurally_derived",
   "confidence": "exact",
   "coverage_note": "An SFC with a <template> block. The same Component key is minted from the <script> block by vue.sfc.component.script, so a render-function SFC with no template is still a Component and no relation addressing vue:component:{path} dangles."
